snippet.description:
Freezer Pops is a bara visual novel where you play as a game developer student in Brazil trying to make extra money to pay the house rent. 

Features
-100+ Gorgeous Scenes;
-2 routes available;
-2 datable guys available;
-4 Endings;
-A Unique Brazilian Adventure;

Available on Steam: https://store.steampowered.com/app/1468430/Freezer_Pops/
Available on Itch.io: https://maledollstudio.itch.io/freezer-pops-bara-business

